# PHASE 12 – NETWORK INDEPENDENCE

Audit the entire application for online dependencies.

Separate local AI functionality from cloud-dependent features.

Local AI:
- Must operate offline.

Supabase:
- Optional synchronization and remote storage.
- Local memory must remain available without it.

Firebase:
- Optional cloud notifications and supported cloud services.
- Local features must not crash if Firebase is unavailable.

Gemini:
- Optional online provider only.
- Never required for local inference.

WhatsApp:
- Existing supported integration may require connectivity and Android permissions.
- Do not claim that internet-dependent message delivery works offline.

Gmail:
- Email synchronization and sending require network connectivity.
- Previously synchronized local email data may remain accessible offline.

Do not confuse offline AI inference with offline external communication.

